          "list": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">A Combat Rifle can accept one each of the following mods:</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Receiver:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.lZXmmJghkwx2Cfth]{Calibrated}</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6BSZSiI20H86MtAb]{Hardened}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.WCJ0QR5lOk9qBuxo]{Automatic}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.pNv4YuXn6LxkcLnj]{Hair Trigger}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.7EV6l9KqHJ6KJpQi]{Powerful}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.hXHvlCvphIQ8x4be]{Advanced}</span>, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.aGA8OrDQbWtDLvim]{.38 Receiver}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.TPOttLy9XWIZ5c2g]{.308 Receiver}<span class=\"fontstyle0\">.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Barrel: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6py6TtlkeywhWQl1]{Long Barrel}</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.cvoae6Grdf6NGVM4]{Ported Barrel}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.ww3t5WpfftCxGRsb]{Vented Barrel}</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Stock:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.ryaBZCITyZP3DoOP]{Full Stock}</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.GcvxfPv8mm8bpxM7]{Marksman's Stock}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.esTu2kHbvyxBdSFV]{Recoil Compensating Stock}</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Magazine:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.COx7kAmBX5tY55ty]{Large Magazine}</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.lcYV8De9jKX8legK]{Quick-Eject Magazine}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.eTh6sOdMe4xVwPOj]{Large Quick-Eject Ma